\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Angiographic volume synthesis and vascular masking. The synthesised angiographic field $\mathcal  {A}(\mathbf  {x})$ combines magnitude and speed evidence; the gold-standard CoW mask is derived from the 7\,T magnitude via a hybrid threshold, bootstrap nnU-Net, and manual correction, and a ResEnc-M U-Net trained with the skeleton-recall loss propagates this mask to the 3\,T and $0.5{\times }3$\,T inputs and to the predicted volumes used in evaluation.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
